      *----------------------------------------------------------------
      * ITEMDEF - one inventory item, 36 characters in inventory.dat.
      * The program that copies this supplies the group above it.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
           10  ITEM-ID             PIC X(6).
           10  ITEM-NAME           PIC X(20).
           10  ITEM-ON-HAND        PIC 9(5).
           10  ITEM-PRICE          PIC 9(5).
